{
    "Comment": [
        "Content-model additions this repository owns, applied on top of the imported",
        "schema metadata in 'schemas' after it is loaded. Like the other",
        "'exyokioffice_' files here, it is meant to survive a re-import of everything",
        "else.",
        "",
        "An entry names an existing type and a list of particle items to append to its",
        "top-level content model. The generator fails the build when the type is gone",
        "or has no content model to extend, so a rename in the imported metadata is",
        "caught rather than silently ignored.",
        "",
        "Only add an entry for markup a released Office application actually writes,",
        "and say which one in 'Reason'."
    ],
    "Types": [
        {
            "Type": "w:CT_RPrBaseStyleable/w:rPr",
            "Reason": "Word writes the 2010 run-property extensions into w:docDefaults/w:rPrDefault/w:rPr - every document it saves carries at least w14:ligatures there. The imported model declares them on w:CT_RPr only.",
            "AppendItems": [
                {
                    "Kind": "Group",
                    "InitialVersion": "Office2010",
                    "Occurs": [{ "Max": 1 }],
                    "Items": [
                        {
                            "Kind": "Sequence",
                            "Items": [
